 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+- Optional `playout.layout: "ersatzrs.playout-index.v1"` reads bounded, hash-verified daily files through one atomic index and shared reader lease. Ordinary folder loading remains the default; invalid indexes never fall back to directory scanning. `describe.contract.playout_layouts` advertises the reader contract (channel config schema `0.1.4`).
+
